ls 3. I'll write down 3.\n\nNext, in the millions place: 7 + 9 equals 16. I'll write down 6 and carry over 1 to the ten millions place.\n\nIn the ten millions place: 4 + 7 plus the carried-over 1 equals 12. I'll write down 2 and carry over 1 to the hundred millions place.\n\nFinally, in the hundred millions place: 4 + 6 plus the carried-over 1 equals 11. I'll write down 11.Therefore, the answer is"]]
